    },
    {
      "start": 12.961,
      "end": 16.656,
      "text": "A massive rock fall at [Tauredunum](/t\u02c8\u0254\u0279\u02c8\u025bd\u02c8un\u02c8\u028cm/) triggered a delta collapse.",
